# 强制 shell 脚本与 Docker 文件使用 LF 换行，避免 CRLF 导致容器内执行失败
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf

# 二进制文件不处理换行
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.tar.gz binary
